&lt;h1 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future with Us —&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EquipmentShare is Hiring a Regional Service Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
