&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain global EHS policies, standards, and governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct multi-site risk assessments and lead mitigation programs across manufacturing, warehouse, R&amp;amp;D, and office environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee regulatory reporting, audit readiness, and compliance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform senior leadership on EHS risk exposure, regulatory changes, and mitigation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
