&lt;li&gt;Lead incident response protocols, root cause analysis, and corrective action programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement in safety culture and operational compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to embed safety and environmental standards into daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Environmental Health &amp;amp; Safety, Engineering, Environmental Science, Occupational Safety, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-12 years of progressive EHS leadership experience in multi-site or global environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of environmental regulations, occupational health and safety standards, and risk management frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in manufacturing, distribution, R&amp;amp;D, or operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in government-contracted, regulated, or public safety industries preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to partner with senior leadership on safety strategy and compliance risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with experience leading audits and regulatory reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional cross-functional collaboration and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based out of our Scottsdale or Boston location and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and 401(k) with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave for all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional &amp;amp; mental wellness support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And yes, we have snacks in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
